    "id": 16,
    "slug": "the-future-of-manufacturing",
    "title": "The Future of Manufacturing: Vision and Predictions Beyond 2026",
    "title_ar": "مستقبل قطاع التصنيع: رؤية وتوقعات لما بعد عام 2026",
    "image": "/blog/the-future-of-manufacturing.jfif",
    "category": "Manufacturing",
